[completion-06] A test asserts that two runs over byte-identical task text produce byte-
    identical review state.
    -> byte-identical-inputs-byte-identical-review-state  [regression/explicit]   (also serves constraint-07)
       Two runs over byte-identical task text produce byte-identical review state.


